//　ふなという名前だったか。先程から、突然の闖入者
//である俺にくっついて離れない。
  The girl―Funa, was it?―<br>claps her hands in amazement. She has been glued to my side since I awoke, a veritable font of questions. 

  She is certainly no shrinking violet. Most children would regard a stranger such as myself with greater scrutiny.

//　物怖じしない性格のようだ。

