//いうものがなくて困っておる。
//　昼は外で遊んでおるから良いが、夜になる
//とうてらの邪魔しかすることがないらしい」
"She's a handful, she is, though I've no idea where she gets it. It's fine during the day, when she can run around outside, but at night, it seems she has nothing better to do than get in our way."

pt:
//【弥源太】
<voice name='弥源太' class='弥源太' src='voice/ma02/0120240b55'>
